From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:27:51 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 035/230] Let users delete their account and every row it owns
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

DELETE /api/me sweeps all of the caller's data in one transaction — favorites,
leagues, predictions, ratings, comments, ledger, totals, streaks, sessions,
credentials, notification prefs, referral codes and redemptions in both
directions, and queued pushes — by walking sqlite_master for owner columns so
a future table cannot escape it. Profile gets an EN/FA confirm sheet. The
suite enumerates every table and proves zero rows remain while a second
user's rows are untouched.
